# NSS_StillPaper_v1
# Still-camera colour-negative paper viewing LUT.
# Input:  Cineon Film Log (OFX Positive Out, out_mode 2).
# Output: Rec.709 display, gamma 2.4.
# Parametric RA-4 paper approximation (Endura / Portra Endura class):
# system contrast 1.50 about mid-grey, chroma 1.12, soft shoulder.
# Neutrals stay neutral. Not copied from any third-party profile.
# Public Kodak paper datasheets inform the qualitative shape only.
TITLE "NSS_StillPaper_v1"
LUT_3D_SIZE 33
LUT_3D_INPUT_RANGE 0.0 1.0

